            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , respectively. Find the height of the poles and the distances of the point from the poles. A"
