              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " A TV tower stands vertically on a bank of a canal. From a point on the other bank directly opposite the tower, the angle of elevation of the top of the tower is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . From another point 20 m away from this point on the line joing this point to the foot of the tower, the angle of elevation of the top of the tower is "
